ing it might advance toward All Simples or No Honors patterns. Also, B1 has been played by across player, so it might be safe.  \\n\\nReason: Discarding B1 removes a terminal, keeps my potential sequences (T3, T4, T5) and pairs (B7, W2), and is relatively safe based on game history.  \\n\\nAnswer: Play B1\"}"}
